  "binding_requirement_for_the_runtime_acceptance": "The runtime acceptance must bind capacity_materials.approval to b69b793fbe0c5e8a42934d49b9c08ec2e1dca7a5e45b49e65c21015473cde541 (the reissued v2), not to the superseded first approval d06494658f1c9ee90e83951ab7a4ff33306ac9ff978f2d3a200baf50f2a8b0d7, which remains on main and points at a proposal declaring 131. Both files exist; only this one is accepted.",
